Spatial-Capture-Recapture Analysis for Feral Cats on Tinian using secr package in R
 
 cat_individuals.Rproj is the R project I am working out of. Run install.packages() for any packages not yet in your R library. 

 The csvs you need for the project are within this folder.

 The pdfs within Resources are useful documents I used to learn about the secr package.
 
If y'all would also like to try the oSCR package, 
I was working upon being able to incorporate our data into the existing code TrapTagger provides 
(for some reason there is no straightforward way; their code is just a function). 
I put a pause on that to push forward and get a secr model running, but that code is in traptagger_oSCR.R. 

The  R scripts that start with old_, you can skip. 
They are failed attempts of mine (I am just holding on to them right now if the script becomes useful). 

The most recent R script is current_secr_analysis.R. It has the current code for the cats secr analysis.

Email me at cb1199@uw.edu with any questions.
